														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2748395">
									

<p>A great SCP, but I have some criticisms of the interview logs. Why is Dr. Bauer referred to as Mr. Johnson by the SCP? Is it a revision error, a pseudonym, or does it have something to do with the SCP? I did notice that the Dr. told it to call him Frank. Why isn't the SCP referred to as SCP-2xxx instead of Jacob? Is the arm an SCP, but not the person? You could also just say that it is preferable to use Jacob for psychological reasons. Finally, the SCP/Jacob mentions fighting terrorists and monsters, much like the MTFs. It shouldn't have that knowledge of the Foundation. I also noticed that the age was sixteen, but his mind seemed to be like that of a ten or twelve year old. Aside from those questions, this is a great SCP.<br />
+1 from me</p>

							</div>

								
					
